OL,3,AAI cancer cures slowed by chip
OL,4,Ashortage, says UK's biggest tech boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of the biggest
OL,7,FUK-headquartered tech firm has said
OL,8,Fthat artifical intelligence will find a
OL,9,Fcure for cancer that humans cannot in
OL,10,Four lifetimes.
OL,12,FRene Haas, chief executive of
OL,13,FCambridge-based chip designer Arm
OL,14,FHoldings, said while modelling how a
OL,15,FDNA marker is impacted by cancer was
OL,16,Fcurrently "too complex" a problem,
OL,17,Fcomputers are "going to solve it" in
OL,18,Fthe future.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
